{"id":"n62470-1-23","stage":3,"title":"발표 · 发表","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62470-1-23-1","ko":"오늘 우리한테 지수가 중대 발표를 하겠다는데?","zh":"今天智秀说要向我们做一项重大宣布，是吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"우리한테","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리한테","audio":"/audio/420f68eee7ab3d9da33a.mp3"}},{"text":"지수가","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}},{"text":"중대","meaning":"重大","explanation":"중대：重大","readings":[{"term":"중대","audio":"/audio/f53e3b28af6a8ec57330.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77292","senseId":"1","lemma":"중대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중대","audio":"/audio/f53e3b28af6a8ec57330.mp3"}},{"text":"발표를","meaning":"发表，发布","explanation":"발표：发表，发布；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"발표","audio":"/audio/662fbb8d7bdeae8019f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62470","senseId":"1","lemma":"발표","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"발표를","audio":"/audio/fb8eecedd8451fb146ac.mp3"}},{"text":"하겠다는데?","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다는데：转述听到的情况，并留下确认、补充或对照的语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":